  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5a73f0ca",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 1️⃣ Example with DTU test datasets"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ebfa1138",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- Evaluating with DTU examples with re10k checkpoints"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "37fbe7a1",
   "metadata": {
    "vscode": {
     "languageId": "powershell"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "python -m src.main +experiment=dtu \\\n",
    "checkpointing.load=checkpoints/re10k.ckpt \\\n",
    "mode=test \\\n",
    "dataset/view_sampler=evaluation \\\n",
    "dataset.view_sampler.index_path=assets/evaluation_index_dtu_nctx2.json \\\n",
    "test.save_video=true \\\n",
    "test.save_image=false \\\n",
    "test.compute_scores=false"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "be162e22",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "이후 렌더링 파일은 `outputs/test/dtu/views2/video` 경로에 생성된다"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6f2c2640",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "##### `convert_dtu.py`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "09ec56da",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def load_images(example_path: Path) -> dict[int, UInt8[Tensor, \"...\"]]:\n",
    "    \"\"\"Load JPG images as raw bytes (do not decode).\"\"\"\n",
    "    images_dict = {}\n",
    "    for cur_id in range(1, 50):\n",
    "        cur_image_name = f\"rect_{cur_id:03d}_3_r5000.png\" # <- 3번 조명만 읽고 있다\n",
    "        img_bin = load_raw(example_path / cur_image_name)\n",
    "        images_dict[cur_id - 1] = img_bin"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a6ddaaff",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "##### `dtu.yaml`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e06989bd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**평가할 때(evaluation)**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3e418d19",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```yaml\n",
    "dataset:\n",
    "    ...\n",
    "    test_times_per_scene: 4 # <- scene마다 4개의 시점을 eval\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ca6d3e8c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "##### `mvsplat\\assets\\evaluation_index_dtu_nctx2.json`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c21c075b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "장면마다 2개의 context view `[33, 31]`을 고정, target view는 `[32, 24, 23, 44]` 중 하나를 지정\n",
    "- 16개의 scene x 4 target view = 64 evaluation samples\n",
    "- `rect_034_3_r5000.png`, `rect_032_3_r5000.png`가 target이 됨"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e7e15bd9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 2️⃣ Converting COLMAP-based datasets"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "20d48625",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Github Issue Page** : https://github.com/donydchen/mvsplat/issues/1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c2fb5f42",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Inference on a COLMAP scene\n",
    "\n",
    "`src.scripts.infer_colmap` renders one target camera using two fixed context images.\n",
    "It reads a COLMAP text model, uses the registered images sorted by filename for\n",
    "zero-based view indices, and does not load the target image. If your COLMAP model is\n",
    "binary, convert it to text first:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "colmap model_converter \\\n",
    "  --input_path PATH_TO_COLMAP_MODEL \\\n",
    "  --output_path PATH_TO_COLMAP_TEXT_MODEL \\\n",
    "  --output_type TXT\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "For undistorted `PINHOLE` or `SIMPLE_PINHOLE` cameras, run:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "python -m src.scripts.infer_colmap \\\n",
    "  --colmap-model path/to/sparse_txt \\\n",
    "  --images path/to/images \\\n",
    "  --checkpoint checkpoints/re10k.ckpt \\\n",
    "  --context-indices 0 7 \\\n",
    "  --target-index 14 \\\n",
    "  --near 1 \\\n",
    "  --far 100 \\\n",
    "  --output outputs/colmap/render.png \\\n",
    "  --ply-output outputs/colmap/gaussians.ply\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "The context and target indices above are fixed for every invocation; indices refer\n",
    "to the filename-sorted registered COLMAP images. Set `--near` and `--far` to bounds\n",
    "appropriate for the COLMAP reconstruction scale. The target camera pose is used for\n",
    "rendering, while its image is not required.\n",
    "\n",
    "**🔹Gauissian Primitives (`.ply`)**\n",
    "\n",
    "The script also exports the inferred\n",
    "Gaussians as a PLY file. The PLY exporter recenters/rescales the point cloud for\n",
    "viewing and writes the view-independent DC color component."
   ]
  },
